### Examples (REST Client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@accessToken = {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Login (dev only) ############################
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "changeMe123"
}

### Profile #####################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Projects list ################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create project ###############################
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "DEMO123",
  "name": "Demo 123",
  "visibility": "private"
}

### Tasks in project #############################
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/101/tasks?status=todo&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create task ##################################
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/101/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "实现登录",
  "description": "...",
  "priority": "high"
}

### Comments for task ############################
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2001/comments?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create comment ###############################
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2001/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "看一下这个变更",
  "mentions": [456]
}

### Notifications ################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?only_unread=true&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

